cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "awesome-manuscript-review-tools"
abstract: >
  A curated list of AI tools for academic manuscript review, pre-submission
  checks, journal compliance, and desk rejection prevention. Includes a
  comparison table covering pre-submission checkers, grammar and language
  polishing tools, AI peer review simulators, journal discovery tools,
  reference managers, and general AI writing assistants.
message: >
  If you reference this list in a publication, blog post, or tool documentation,
  please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
license: CC0-1.0
